{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":45801,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793474990109,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2012,"episodeCount":48,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbF0r11g9w0e8eUBYTAkSApecLQ.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"904544","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Un inizio emozionante","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Whilst running to the first day of her new school, the happy-go-lucky Miyuki Hoshizora encounters a fairy named Candy, who leaves behind a pink book. As Miyuki has trouble introducing herself to the class, her classmate Akane Hino helps her to break the ice. As Miyuki checks out the library later that day, she discovers a mysterious entrance, taking her to a strange place where she learns Candy is being chased by a wolf named Wolfrun, who starts making the people in the town fall into despair and steals their 'bad energy' with a goal of ressurecting someone named Pierrot. As Miyuki strives to protect Candy, she is given a magical item known as the Smile Pact, using it to transform into a PreCure named Cure Happy. As Miyuki becomes reluctant to fight, Wolfrun summons a monster known as an Akanbe to fight against her, but with help from Candy, Miyuki manages to realise her power and defeat it, receiving an item known as a Cure Decor.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jgG8ZlhNbJ4b2sFhozD5oq1mOrI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jgG8ZlhNbJ4b2sFhozD5oq1mOrI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"904545","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"La trasformazione di Kelsey","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"私がプリキュア!? よくわからないけど、面白そう！ ウルトラオッケー！ キャンディによると、プリキュアは全部で５人もいるんだって。って、オオカミさんがまたやってきたー！ 同じクラスでバレー部の日野さんが危ない！ 助けないと！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d144Z9Vu4GUzdmjNVjk5IqLNrxd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d144Z9Vu4GUzdmjNVjk5IqLNrxd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"904546","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Vogliamo la pace! La Glitter Gialla!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"あかねちゃんがキュアサニー！ 2人一緒ならハッピーも2倍。あと3人探すぞ～！ そんな時、学校のポスターコンクールのクラス代表を選ぶことに。私とあかねちゃんは、イラストが上手な黄瀬さんを推薦したんだけど…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rlmYdFrlGz3gPI7PhiMoTrv8bci.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlmYdFrlGz3gPI7PhiMoTrv8bci.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"904547","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Ecco la Glitter Verde!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"お弁当の場所を横取りされそうになっていたら、同じクラスの緑川さんが助けてくれたの！ 正義感あふれる緑川さんは、スポーツ万能で学校の人気者。プリキュアを一緒にやってほしいけど、なかなか声がかけられなくて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dLbxHraAHoxSecjhJklzdCjEV27.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dLbxHraAHoxSecjhJklzdCjEV27.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"904548","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Glitter Blu contro la strega","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"プリキュア全員集合まで、いよいよあと一人。最後の一人は…絶対、学級委員で生徒会副会長の青木さんだよね。誰にでも優しく責任感が強くて、頭もいいの！ 早速みんなでお願いに行ったんだけど、今は忙しくてできないって…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-03-04","l