だろう？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g170bO4Z5VP58nstMwbOzQ3YnBR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g170bO4Z5VP58nstMwbOzQ3YnBR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"904571","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"A caccia di fantasmi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"私となおちゃんのおばけ嫌いを克服するために、きもだめしをすることになっちゃった！ おばけなんていないよね…でも、学校の中では不思議なことが次々と起こるの。これってもしかして、おばけのしわざ？ それとも…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p1Hf9dMR7su58YQXjCjzk15aMQ9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p1Hf9dMR7su58YQXjCjzk15aMQ9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"904572","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Un gioco pericoloso","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"夏休み最後の日。でも宿題が終わってなぁ～い！ そんな時、落ちていたサイコロを振ったら、ゲームの世界に吸い込まれちゃった！ 時間内にゲームをクリアしないと元の世界に戻れない！って、早く戻って宿題しなきゃ～！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-09-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/koVzGHbO8uYVGaAAsBQ0mGdj34g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/koVzGHbO8uYVGaAAsBQ0mGdj34g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"904573","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Il giro del mondo in ottanta libri","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ふしぎ図書館の本棚を使って、みんなでいざ世界旅行へ！ フランスやモンゴル、中国にアメリカ、みんなの行ってみたい国をまわって、最後にアマゾン川で記念撮影！ って、あれ!? アカオーニが一緒に写ってる～！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7UTAdk4uVn4hxEBBvtVpyJUFg1f.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7UTAdk4uVn4hxEBBvtVpyJUFg1f.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"904574","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"L'Orologio Reale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついにキュアデコルが全部揃ったの！ でも、現れたのは、時計のようなもの…。そんな時、ウルフルンのせいで街がバッドエンド空間に！ そこに現れたジョーカーの不思議な玉に、キャンディが閉じ込められちゃって…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55x5hTgyhPqj3WXBympAHUDCCfQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55x5hTgyhPqj3WXBympAHUDCCfQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"904575","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Un incubo perfetto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ジョーカーの「なまけ玉」に、みんなが閉じ込められちゃった！ 私がみんなを助け出してみせる！ でも「なまけ玉」の中に入ってみたら、みんな部活も宿題もしないで、プリキュアも知らないって…どうしちゃったの!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-09-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Orpyz8vbJMgpWTkHQ6SP1yrXF2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Orpyz8vbJMgpWTkHQ6SP1yrXF2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"904576","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日は時代劇映画村の見学へ！ みんなで映画のマネをして遊んでいたら、監督から映画に出てみないかって誘われちゃった！ 映画に出られるなんてウルトラハッピー！ でも、あれ？ この男の子って…もしかして、ポップ～!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-09-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t0x2m3mRQcnUWvOx8QzGGYgNpg0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t0x2m3mRQcnUWvOx8QzGGYgNpg0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"904577","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"やってきました文化祭！ 私たちのクラスはみんなでファッションショーをするの！ でも、クラスメイトの豊島くんは一緒にやらないって…どうしてなのかな？ 私は絶対みんなでやりたい！ 一緒に楽しくやる方法を考えよう！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uE8CVCDzfPNnK3IloxEIL5y3qhj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uE8CVCDzfPNnK3IloxEIL5y3qhj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"904578","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Super-Rosa-Robot","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みんなでやよいちゃんの大好きなロボットのオモチャを買いに出かけたら、マジョリーナたちに会っちゃった！ マジョリーナが発明した「ロボニナ～ル」の光を浴びたら…え～!? 私、巨大ロボになっちゃったよ～！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1pM3mbND1v66Sja3qKrvjCmRBXR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pM3mbND1v66Sja3qKrvjCmRBXR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"904579","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"イギリスから留学生がやってきた！ 名前はブライアン。3週間だけ日本へ勉強に来たんだって。学校や街の案内をすることになったあかねちゃん。ブライアンといるとドキドキするみたい。それって、もしかして…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eeqRQTiGaYmzegqqRZe3YBR0BkM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eeqRQTiGaYmzegqqRZe3YBR0BkM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45801/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"904580","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"La candidatura di Chloe","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"もうすぐ生徒会選挙！ もちろん、今年の生徒会長はれいかちゃ